 "remarks": "A charming 3 bedroom Cape Cod-style vintage home. The large remodeled eat-in-kitchen is the hub of the home. The living room has a beautiful stone faced fireplace and golden oak floors. There is a cozy enclosed porch at the front of the home. The dining room has built-in shelving and parquet flooring. There is a first floor bedroom and full bath on the main floor.  Upstairs there are two more bedrooms. There is a full basement for storage, with a Bilko door to the yard. The beautiful, flat quarter-acre yard is fenced in for privacy or playtime for your pets. The location is advantageous to a commuter being walking distance to the Glenbrook Metro North Train. A short bike-ride to Cove Island Beach, and minutes to the vibrant downtown Stamford. Welcome home.",
